sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Gateway<br/>80/443 TCP
    participant Proxy as Envoy Proxy<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as EPP<br/>9002/TCP gRPC ext-proc
    participant Sidecar as Routing Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Prefill as Prefill Worker<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Decode as Decode Worker<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant ModelServer as Model Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 1: Standalone Mode (Aggregated)
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        Proxy->>EPP: ext-proc endpoint selection<br/>gRPC 9002/TCP
        EPP-->>Proxy: Selected model server endpoint
        Proxy->>ModelServer: Forward inference request<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        ModelServer-->>Proxy: Inference response
        Proxy-->>Client: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Client,Decode: Flow 2: Disaggregated P/D Inference
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        Proxy->>EPP: ext-proc selects P+D endpoints<br/>gRPC 9002/TCP
        EPP-->>Proxy: Prefill + Decode endpoints
        Proxy->>Sidecar: Forward to decode pod sidecar<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        Sidecar->>Prefill: Prefill request<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        Note over Prefill,Decode: NIXL RDMA KV Cache Transfer<br/>(InfiniBand/RoCE, GPUDirect)
        Prefill-->>Decode: KV cache transfer via RDMA
        Decode-->>Sidecar: Decode response<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        Sidecar-->>Proxy: Final response
        Proxy-->>Client: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 3: Gateway Mode
        Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, TLS terminated
        Gateway->>EPP: ext-proc endpoint selection<br/>gRPC 9002/TCP
        EPP-->>Gateway: Selected endpoint
        Gateway->>ModelServer: Forward request<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        ModelServer-->>Gateway: Inference response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON response
    end
